The context provided indicates that Jesus speaks about loving God (the Father) in the context of John 1:12. In this passage, Jesus states: "Everyone who believes that Jesus is the Christ born of God, and who loves the one who gave him, loves him." This means that Jesus emphasizes that those who love God (the Father) will be born of Him.

Thus, the answer to the question "What does Jesus say about loving God?" is that Jesus says everyone who loves God (the Father) will be born of Him.

\boxed{Jesus says that everyone who loves God (the Father) will be born of him.}
